1
00:00:00,341 --> 00:00:05,478
My assignments and my profile — Find your way around the top bar, see the hours you have left, and keep your details up to date.

2
00:00:06,489 --> 00:00:13,635
The top bar is the same on every WorkDesk tab. On the left: Back, and the house — back to the Employee Portal home.

3
00:00:14,443 --> 00:00:18,546
The tabs below are the parts of WorkDesk your role may open.

4
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:25,714
On the right: the light or dark theme, your assignments, the language, the Knowledge Base, the Handbook, and your profile.

5
00:00:26,592 --> 00:00:29,101
Let's open My assignments and allowances.

6
00:00:32,076 --> 00:00:37,624
Every project and work order you're assigned to, with your allowance — the hours you may report there.

7
00:00:38,443 --> 00:00:44,466
Consumed, what's in approval, and what remains — with a bar that turns amber, then red, as you get close.

8
00:00:45,217 --> 00:00:48,649
Running out? Request hours asks your manager for more.

9
00:00:51,443 --> 00:00:55,969
Say how many hours, and why. The request goes to the approval queue.

10
00:01:00,172 --> 00:01:02,677
Your name opens My profile.

11
00:01:05,485 --> 00:01:11,499
Your role, team, manager, contract hours and portal access — and Edit my details for your mobile and birthday.

12
00:01:12,418 --> 00:01:18,114
You can keep your birthday private. Below are the language, the layout on this device, and Sign out.

13
00:01:20,862 --> 00:01:24,981
Assignments · allowances · profile — More help: the Handbook → My assignments and allowances.
